/// F1 (noc-alerts-config) — editable, single-row config for the fiber-alert
/// thresholds served by `GET/PUT /api/alerts/thresholds`. Molde
/// NocBroadcastConfig/GestionRealIngestConfig — id "singleton". Defaults
/// mirror `/etc/fibra_report.conf` on VM 130.
///
/// FIELD NAMES ARE THE WIRE CONTRACT shared with the Rust collector
/// (`ipnext-noc-collector/src/config.rs::Thresholds`,
/// `#[serde(rename_all = "camelCase")]`) — critDbm/warnDbm/deltaAlert/
/// ponMinAbon/ponDelta EXACT. Do not rename without updating that repo too
